The powers of the authority shall include, but not be limited to, the power:
(1) Of public authorities provided by the Revenue Bond Law of Georgia (Ga. Code Chapter 87-8) [O.C.G.A. § 36-82-60 et seq.,] as it has been or may hereafter be amended, and where the same are additional to or complementary of and not inconsistent with the powers herein expressly enumerated;
